---
import Link from "@/components/Link.astro";
import HomeAvatarSignature from "@/components/HomeAvatarSignature.astro";
// import Callout from "@/components/Callout.astro";
import "../styles/flag-icons.scss";
---

<h1 class="text-lg font-semibold">
  👋 Hi, I'm BrainB0ne ...
</h1>
<article class="space-y-4">
  <span>
    <!--
    <p>
      <Callout type="construction">
        Under construction: fasten your seatbelts💺<br>
        Things might suddenly break 💔 or change 🔃 during updates.
      </Callout>
    </p>
    -->
    <p>
    I build software, automate things, break them, fix them, and write about the process.<br>
    BrainByteZ is my corner of the internet where I share practical guides, open-source projects, self-hosting experiments, hardware hacks, and lessons learned along the way.<br>
    </p>
    <p>
    Most posts start with a problem I needed to solve and end with something worth sharing.<br>
    </p>
    <p>
    You'll find articles in both English ( <span class="fi fi-us"></span> ) and Dutch ( <span class="fi fi-nl"></span> ), depending on the topic and audience.<br>
    </p>
    <p>
    This site is powered by <Link external href="https://astro.build">Astro</Link> 🚀
    and uses the minimalistic <Link external href="https://astro-micro.vercel.app">Astro Micro</Link> 🔬 theme.<br>
    </p>
    <p>
    All blog posts from my previous website have been migrated here to preserve the content and keep everything in one place.<br>
    Unfortunately, the original comments didn't make the move.<br>
    </p>
    <p>
    Grab a coffee, explore, and hopefully discover something useful.
    </p>
    <HomeAvatarSignature size="w-22" />
  </span>
</article>
